<title>BULGARIA: GOVERNMENT LIST.</title>
<headline>GOVERNMENT LIST.</headline>
<text>
<p>BULGARIA GOVERNMENT LIST (970625)</p>
<p> President**......Petar STOYANOV</p>
<p> Vice-president**.............Todor KAVALDZHIEV</p>
<p>(**Sworn in 19 Jan 97, took office 22 Jan)</p>
<p>				 - - - - - - -</p>
<p>CABINET: (Formed 21 May 97)</p>
<p> Prime Minister......Ivan KOSTOV</p>
<p> Deputy Prime Minister (i/c of Economic Policy).Alexander BOZHKOV</p>
<p>  (Also Minister of Industry)</p>
<p> Deputy Prime Minister (i/c of Regional </p>
<p>   Infrastructure Policy.Evgeni BAKARDZHIEV</p>
<p>  (Also Minister of Regional Development &amp; Public Works)</p>
<p> Deputy Prime Minister (i/c of Culture, Education</p>
<p>	  &amp; Administrative Reform............. Vesselin METODIEV</p>
<p>  (Also Minister of Education &amp; Science)</p>
<p>				 - - - - - - -</p>
<p>MINISTERS:</p>
<p> Agriculture, Forests &amp; Land Reform .......Ventsislav VARBANOV</p>
<p> Culture.............Ema MOSKOVA</p>
<p> Defence..........Georgi ANANIEV</p>
<p> Ecology &amp; Water..Evdokia MANEVA</p>
<p> Education &amp; Science.............see Deputy Pms</p>
<p> Finance...........Muravei RADEV</p>
<p> Foreign Affairs.............Nadezhda MIHAILOVA</p>
<p> Health.........Petar BOYADZHIEV</p>
<p> Industry.........See Deputy PMs</p>
<p> Interior..........Bogomil BONEV</p>
<p> Justice &amp; European Legislative Integration......Vassil GOTSEV</p>
<p> Labour &amp; Social Care Policy .......Ivan NEIKOV</p>
<p> State Administration..........Mario TAGARINSKI</p>
<p> Regional Development &amp; Public Works .......... see Deputy PMs</p>
<p> Trade &amp; Tourism..............Valentin VASSILEV</p>
<p> Transport.........Wilhelm KRAUS</p>
<p>				 - - - - - - -</p>
<p> Parliamentary Speaker...........Yordan SOKOLOV</p>
<p>				 - - - - - - -</p>
<p> Central Bank Governor......Svetoslav GAVRIISKI</p>
<p>				 - - - - - - -</p>
